Contact by Carl Sagan
  A scientifically grounded story about humanity's first radio communication with an alien civilization and the journey to meet them.
The Left Hand of Darkness by Ursula K. Le Guin
  A profound exploration of first contact and cultural understanding as a human envoy visits an alien world with a unique gender-fluid society.
Childhood's End by Arthur C. Clarke
  A thought-provoking tale of peaceful alien arrival on Earth and the mysterious transformation they guide humanity through.
